 after={META[i]:encoded(x)for i,x in[(0,papers),(1,inventory),(2,summary),(7,ledger)]};preface='# Current nf-core source-use reviews\n\n'+NOTICE+'\n\n'+SCOPE+'\n\n**Warnings and required actions:** '+ACTION+'\n\nSee [reviewed roles](../nfcore-reviewed-source-audit/ROLES.json) and [handover](../nfcore-source-review/HANDOVER.md). Earlier checkpoints below are historical.\n\n---\n\n'
